{"id":1050404,"chapter_id":1050404,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"口袋里的终端震了两下，你走在队伍的最后面，悄悄拿起来看了一眼。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"麦昆","content":"抱歉~我亲爱的小灰狼~虽然答应你和你一起共同演绎一场精彩的剧目……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":11,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"麦昆","content":"但我着实舍不得让我的小苹果没法准时下班~","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":11,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"麦昆","content":"你那个什么线索，被我压在门口的沙发坐垫下面了，拜托你咯~","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":11,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"看着通讯终端上的信息，你的手有些微微颤抖。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"咦……这里好像是个画廊？但是门是锁着的，里面也像是没有人的样子……难道我们扑空了？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"<i>“门……门确实打不开了，冒险家们有些惊讶，但很快镇定了下来。”</i>","style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"唔？这是什么情况……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"<i>“艾米潘并不是一个非常聪明的冒险家……“</i>","style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"……算了，你是GM（管理者），你说了算。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"<i>“因此，冒险家们觉得，既然会愿意把线索交给艾米潘，那这位……呃，这位售卖线索的商人，应该能预料到冒险家们会追问过来。”</i>","style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"<i>“所以，聪明的冒险家们认为，这位商人要么把相关信息留在了他们肉眼可见的范围里，要么……就压根没有离开。”</i>","style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"爱缇摸着下巴思考了好一会儿，随后便指使九十九把海拉从沙发上抱下来，开始翻找。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"这个蓝色的沙发，是一直摆在外面的，集市上的人已经习惯了。但我们是第一次来的人，所以这对我们来说是一个非常明显的提示！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"利用大家所忽视的常规物品，来向新朋友传达信息，很明哲保身的做法呀~","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"在坐垫和沙发的靠背之间，爱缇抽出来一张陈旧的信纸，夹在两指中间。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"不过……这个线索倒是有点奇怪……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"剩下的三个人好奇地凑过来，看见爱缇手上的信纸——那是一张和艾米潘贡献出来的线索一模一样的东西。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"一只展翅的巨龙，高仰着头，朝着前方飞翔。只不过，它们两个是完全地以中轴为对称的图形。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"海拉","content":"诶，你看，它们右下角各有一句诗的样子？是线索吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"嚯？你还会念诗……哎哟你踢我干嘛！！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我看看……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"爱缇把艾米潘的线索放在上面，商人的线索放在下面，凑出了一首完整的诗歌——","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"“风吹凉的地方，是我曾亲吻过的故乡。”\n“龙首永远朝向光明，是我必须前行的方向。”","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"嘶……好像懂了，又好像没懂。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"海拉","content":"没懂就没懂吧，还好像懂了……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"几个人看着两张一样的巨龙，再一次陷入了沉默。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"speaker":"九十九","content":"风……风吹过的地方……是指……风的方向吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"夜晚的风吹起了九十九的头发，她将吹乱的发丝勾回耳后，突然问到。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"风……方向……对称的巨龙……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我知道了！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"爱缇在地上找到两支破木棍，接了点艾米潘和海拉捏脸打架时滴落的涎水。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"将两张纸贴对称地贴在木棍上，松松地拿在手里，举了起来。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"轻风吹过，手里的木棍转动方向，龙身轻轻摆动，所有人看到龙的头颅，摇啊摇地，指向了它的前方。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"没错！传说中的城堡！就在那边！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"爱缇激动地跳了起来，双手举得高高的。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"那一定是一座黑暗，危险，充满陷阱的城堡！只有这样的城堡，才配囚禁光明！才值得我去征服！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"content":"你的意识中，枷锁突然跳动了一下，你看着爱缇发光的眼睛，微微皱眉。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"<i>“冒险家们破译了商人留下来的信息，知道了传说中的城堡位于何处。”</i>","style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"<i>“这将是一条充满险阻，困难的危险之路，稍有不慎，冒险家们甚至会被黑暗吞没。”</i>","style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"<i>“可是冒险家们对自己非常自信——当然，她们同样信任着自己同伴。”</i>","style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"爱缇泛光的眼睛渐渐地平息下来，她看了看身后的几个人，又看了看你，什么话也没说，做了“跟上我”的手势，便又往前走去。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"<i>“就这样，法师爱缇，野蛮人九十九，游荡者海拉，吟游诗人艾米潘，四个被命运选中的冒险家们，选择向黑暗前进，夺回光明。”</i>","style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"深夜时分，你带着冒险家们，来到了新城的一个角落——一栋几乎被夜色掩盖的房屋出现在众人眼前。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"<i>“夜色下，冒险家们无法看清城堡的全貌，但是里面随风传来的低吼声，昭示着它的阴森与可怖。”</i>","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"杂乱的石料，破碎的铁丝网，众人在围栏外停了下来，商量对策。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"海拉","content":"爱缇？怎么愣在那不说话啊，你不是一向主意最多，看看我们要怎么杀进去，给那“大魔王”一个惊喜呀！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"……我不知道。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"不知道？连连连你都不知道……？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"难难难道里面真的有什么……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"爱缇叹了口气，恢复成原来的表情，拍了拍艾米潘。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我是说，就是不知道里面是什么，才好玩啊。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"夜色下，爱缇的面庞一半都浸入了黑暗，附近隐约闪烁的霓虹灯反射过来，给爱缇加上了一层令人不安的色彩。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"龙是无畏的，强大的，主宰一切的生物——","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我身为龙的使者，龙的代表，我将无惧一切未知！恐惧也应当恐惧我的强大！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"而你们……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"content":"爱缇张开双手，似是要拥抱，又似是要束缚一般，面对着自己的伙伴。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我亲爱的同伴……命运的指引者……既然你们与我同在，那……一定也足够强大，配得上……在我左右。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"爱缇嘴角的笑容还未隐去，她重新拿起了自己法杖，带领所有人，一步步地，走向了“城堡。”","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"希望我的命运之神，为我在这座传说中的城堡里，安排了最最精彩的战斗！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"吱呀一声，“城堡”的大门被打开。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"没有恶灵，没有怪兽，没有任何想象中的诡异画面，只有无穷无尽的黑暗，每走一步，就好像有什么被吞噬掉一般的黑暗。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"海拉","content":"我不喜欢这里……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"我感觉还不如有点什么东西……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"九十九","content":"这样的环境，会让人焦躁。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"<i>“无边的黑暗，让冒险家们不由地想到了，倘若光明真的有一天被完全夺去，世界上的每一个角落，都会像这个城堡一样。”</i>","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"<i>“而这里的所有人，正是为了避免这样的情况发生，而勇敢走到这里的人。”</i>","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"<i>“冒险家们的勇气与善良，化作了一丝丝光芒，从她们的胸口迸发，照亮了这一方黑暗——”</i>","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"content":"<i>“于是她们看到了——在城堡中，镇压光明，散布黑暗的魔王——”</i>","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"content":"一盏惨白的灯光被打开，像极了审查室天花板上的射灯。在这灯光之下，众人看到了一位……魔王。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"“魔王”端坐在魔法阵的中央，举着一块……绘本。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"“魔王”","content":"<i>“哼哼哼╭(╯^╰)╮”</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"speaker":"“魔王”","content":"<i>“弱小的冒险家们哟！”</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"“魔王”","content":"<i>“我知道你们为何而来！但是！要想得到魔盒，必须得打败我——”</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"speaker":"“魔王”","content":"<i>“然而！打败我！是一件绝不可能的事情！”</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"content":"面对“魔王”的挑衅，爱缇缓缓地睁开眼睛，像一只紧盯宝藏的巨龙一般。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"你知道吗，巨龙时常被视作是最后最强的怪物的存在。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"所以……在巨龙面前，就算是魔王，也不值一提哦~","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"content":"爱缇一甩披风，仰起头，站在魔王的面前，开始排布冒险家们的进攻顺序。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"游荡者第一轮优先上场，拆除魔王周围的一切陷阱！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"海拉","content":"嘿嘿，就交给我吧！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"随后，野蛮人使用狂暴技能，给予魔王疼痛打击！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"speaker":"九十九","content":"好。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"吟游诗人的闪光箭麻烦轮到你的回合时继续释放，让我们的魔王大人，至少两回合无法动弹。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_85"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"没问题，看我的吧！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"最后，给我一分钟。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"content":"爱缇举起自己的魔杖，重重地撞在地板上。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我会将这里，变成一片冰原！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"content":"命运的骰子开始转动。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"content":"面对四位冒险家的轮番攻击，尤其是当她们拥有一位出色的法师指挥，方才不可一世的魔王，渐渐处于了下风。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"“魔王”","content":"可……可恶！你们给我等着瞧！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"“魔王”","content":"那个那个，命运之神？我记得我是不是有个攻城弩的？！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"嗯？可是那个不是用来摧毁城墙的吗？不对……魔王能有这玩意儿？！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"content":"咳咳，命运之神说能有，那就能有。","style":2,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"speaker":"“魔王”","content":"你……你们四个坏家伙！尝尝这个吧！！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"content":"魔王把绘本一撕，露出一副简笔画来，上面赫然是一具攻击力极高的攻城弩。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"我超，挨了这玩意儿一箭，不会成肉末吧！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_99"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"speaker":"九十九","content":"看上去……凶多吉少。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_100"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"speaker":"海拉","content":"爱缇……！！想想办法呀！！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"content":"魔王嘻嘻地笑着，对准四人直接使用了威力强大的弩箭！","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"content":"冒险家们来不及反应！被弩箭激起的攻击波冲得四散开来，伤痕累累。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"speaker":"“魔王”","content":"不可能，这种情况下她们应该失败了才对啊！怎么还都活着呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"content":"发现“命运之神”GM（管理者）没有宣判冒险家们失败，魔王登时有些急了。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"哈……哈哈！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"content":"爱缇撑着魔杖，慢慢地站起来，擦了擦脸上的灰尘，骄傲地看着魔王。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"你认为我会什么准备都不做，就来挑战你吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_108"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"抱歉，让你失望了——早在进来之前，我就对我的同伴们施展了防御的法术。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哈，所以……你的必杀技，根本杀不死我们！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_110"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"虽然确实挺疼的，但是没想到吧，魔王！我们还能继续战斗！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_111"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"九十九","content":"嗯，我会让你尝尝我的厉害！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"content":"看着眼前的阵势，魔王默默地低下了头，看上去似乎沉浸在了自己的劣势之中。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"speaker":"？？？","content":"真不错……真是厉害的冒险家啊。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_114"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"content":"魔王的身后，突然传来另一道女性声音，其冰冷的语气，让在场的所有人都抖了一下。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"content":"众人盯着那处黑暗的漩涡，良久之后，一位绿色头发的女性走了出来，接替了魔王的位置。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"speaker":"魔王","content":"能打败我的“替身”，你们已经很厉害了……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_117"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"speaker":"魔王","content":"我虽然想要真正地打败你们，但……我发现了一件更想做的事情。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_118"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"content":"真正的魔王抬起手，指向了爱缇。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"speaker":"魔王","content":"你的队友脆弱不堪，而你比她们厉害百倍……不如，抛弃他们，和我站在一起，怎么样？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_120"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"speaker":"魔王","content":"黑暗与巨龙，从来都是最默契的搭档，我们二人联手，这个世界……将会永远属于我们。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"content":"听毕魔王的话，海拉忍不住开口喊道。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"speaker":"海拉","content":"你在打什么算盘呢！！爱缇才不会听你的！对吧！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404123,"trial_step":123},{"step":124,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"对，我怎么可能听你的呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_124"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"speaker":"海拉","content":"你看！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_125"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404125,"trial_step":125},{"step":126,"content":"爱缇一步一步走向魔王，好看的异色眼睛，微微泛起了光芒。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404126,"trial_step":126},{"step":127,"content":"魔王眉头轻皱起，不解地看向爱缇。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404127,"trial_step":127},{"step":128,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"站在你这边，和你并肩……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_128"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404128,"trial_step":128},{"step":129,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"你的提议也太无趣了……魔王怎么可能会是这样的心态来面对敌人啊？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_129"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404129,"trial_step":129},{"step":130,"content":"魔王被爱缇说得有点心虚，轻轻地瞟了你一眼。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404130,"trial_step":130},{"step":131,"speaker":"魔王","content":"哦？那……那依你看，怎样才算是……有趣？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_131"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404131,"trial_step":131},{"step":132,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"如果是我，我会如何掌控这场游戏呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_132"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404132,"trial_step":132},{"step":133,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我……我会将我的同伴，全部献祭于黑暗。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_133"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404133,"trial_step":133},{"step":134,"speaker":"海拉","content":"什么？！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_134"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404134,"trial_step":134},{"step":135,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"啊？！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404135,"trial_step":135},{"step":136,"speaker":"九十九","content":"……","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404136,"trial_step":136},{"step":137,"content":"爱缇吃吃地笑着，看上去甚至有些狰狞。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404137,"trial_step":137},{"step":138,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"然后……把你和她们混在一起，成为我称霸世界的垫脚石！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404138,"trial_step":138},{"step":139,"speaker":"魔王","content":"等等！局……！！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_139"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404139,"trial_step":139},{"step":140,"content":"爱缇压根没有等到魔王说完自己的意愿，她猛地一挥手，周围的黑暗像活过来一般，淹没了她，并且扭动着涌向所有人！","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404140,"trial_step":140},{"step":141,"content":"爱缇！停下！！你这是在做什么？！想要重新创造一个艾丝缇雅吗？！","style":2,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404141,"trial_step":141},{"step":142,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"不……当然不是。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_142"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404142,"trial_step":142},{"step":143,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"但也不全是错的。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_143"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404143,"trial_step":143},{"step":144,"content":"爱缇操控着黑暗，你们无法看清她的表情。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404144,"trial_step":144},{"step":145,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"从我踏入这里的那一刻，我就知道……吞噬光明的人，是我。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_145"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404145,"trial_step":145},{"step":146,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我知道这里是哪儿……可它居然已经变成一片漆黑，什么都没有了……明明以前，只要我打开家门，就会是他制作的，不同的游戏场景。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_146"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404146,"trial_step":146},{"step":147,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"爷爷也会扮演成不同的NPC，带我进入游戏的世界……不管我在外面有多孤独，只要回到这里，我便不会是独自一个人。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_147"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404147,"trial_step":147},{"step":148,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"可是我差点丢失这些温暖的记忆……即便最后找回来了，如果有更快乐的回忆让我又忘掉了它们……那我该怎么办？！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_148"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404148,"trial_step":148},{"step":149,"content":"爱缇的脚下，催生出更多更多的黑暗，她头顶的白色灯也被一圈一圈地缠绕，光明……几乎就要消失了。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404149,"trial_step":149},{"step":150,"speaker":"海拉","content":"啧，你好麻烦呀！我都不想玩了！如果你认为，这样更好的话……那就把我丢给黑暗吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_150"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404150,"trial_step":150},{"step":151,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"……","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404151,"trial_step":151},{"step":152,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"是啊，如果你觉得这个结局更好，那就当我们冒险家输了嘛，你变成魔王，你赢了！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_152"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404152,"trial_step":152},{"step":153,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"你们……不害怕输？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_153"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404153,"trial_step":153},{"step":154,"speaker":"九十九","content":"输不可怕，我经常输给海拉和局长，一场游戏而已，开心就行。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_154"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404154,"trial_step":154},{"step":155,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"你们根本不懂……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_155"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404155,"trial_step":155},{"step":156,"speaker":"九十九","content":"我懂的，我知道回忆是支撑一个人行动、生活的力量来源。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_156"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404156,"trial_step":156},{"step":157,"speaker":"九十九","content":"但现在也很好，我没有忘记，也不会忘记，我也会让自己快乐。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_157"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404157,"trial_step":157},{"step":158,"content":"爱缇的手有些颤抖，她咬着下唇，似乎在忍着什么。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404158,"trial_step":158},{"step":159,"content":"然而下一秒，黑暗还是吞没掉了除了你与爱缇之外的所有人。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404159,"trial_step":159},{"step":160,"content":"爱缇，不要重现天空岛，掌控一切只会让你失控！","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404160,"trial_step":160},{"step":161,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"失控……？但我已经掌控这里了，掌控了你的弱点——那些人。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_161"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404161,"trial_step":161},{"step":162,"content":"周围的景色开始变幻，红色的精神世界突然包围住你们，爱缇眼里的神色和你在天空岛时见到的无二。","style":3,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404162,"trial_step":162},{"step":163,"content":"那是掌控的极致，是身为主宰者才会有的神情。","style":3,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404163,"trial_step":163},{"step":164,"content":"是吗……","style":2,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404164,"trial_step":164},{"step":165,"content":"可惜，你也说过，我是“命运之神”。","style":2,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404165,"trial_step":165},{"step":166,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"那又如何？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_166"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404166,"trial_step":166},{"step":167,"content":"命运……总会让你走上该走的道路。","style":2,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404167,"trial_step":167},{"step":168,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"没错~！可我向来……最喜欢挣脱命运给我定下的轨迹。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_168"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404168,"trial_step":168},{"step":169,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"当然，我也很尊重命运——","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_169"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404169,"trial_step":169},{"step":170,"content":"爱缇一挥手，拿出了一枚星空色的骰子。","style":3,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404170,"trial_step":170},{"step":171,"content":"你认得，那是爱缇的专属骰子。你大概了解了爱缇想要做什么，于是拿出了属于自己的，纯白色的命运之子。","style":3,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404171,"trial_step":171},{"step":172,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"规则你应该知道，但我还是希望你清楚……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_172"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404172,"trial_step":172},{"step":173,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"这个地方，由我来掌控，就算你赢了……我也会想办法颠覆你的。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_173"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404173,"trial_step":173},{"step":174,"content":"既然如今我即是命运……那我相信，命运之神会站在我这边。","style":2,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404174,"trial_step":174},{"step":175,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"那好，祝你好运。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_175"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404175,"trial_step":175},{"step":176,"content":"爱缇轻轻一挥，她的骰子在半空中旋转起来，而你也将白色的骰子往前一抛，与之相撞。","style":3,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404176,"trial_step":176},{"step":177,"content":"两枚骰子渐渐地缓慢下来，你能感受到自己的心跳却越来越快。","style":3,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404177,"trial_step":177},{"step":178,"content":"精神世界的红色花海逐渐扩大，狂厄的力量越来越明显——","style":3,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404178,"trial_step":178},{"step":179,"content":"两枚骰子轻轻贴地，轻轻的嗡鸣声，为命运与强大的对决划上了句号。","style":3,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404179,"trial_step":179},{"step":180,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"亲爱的命运之神……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_180"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404180,"trial_step":180},{"step":181,"content":"爱缇眼中的光芒愈升，笑容愈发诡异。","style":3,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404181,"trial_step":181},{"step":182,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"你生来就是要被颠覆的呢。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_182"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":110,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404182,"trial_step":182},{"step":183,"content":"周围的一切猝然安静，浓烈的黑色迅速地包裹住你的全身，逐渐侵蚀掉你的感官，意识。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404183,"trial_step":183},{"step":184,"content":"在最后的意识模糊之际，你感受到了一股强大的狂厄力量朝你奔涌而来。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404184,"trial_step":184},{"step":185,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"再见，亲爱的局长。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_185"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404185,"trial_step":185},{"step":186,"content":"耳鸣、颤栗……可当这些都褪去后……你发现，想象中的事情，似乎完全没有发生。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404186,"trial_step":186},{"step":187,"content":"你缓缓地，尝试着抬起眼皮……","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404188,"trial_step":188},{"step":188,"content":"温和的灯光倾泻而下，你看清了眼前笑得蔫坏蔫坏的人。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404189,"trial_step":189},{"step":189,"options":["解释一下"],"style":6,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404190,"trial_step":190,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"解释一下","goto":191}]},{"step":190,"content":"你最好能给我解释一下……","style":2,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404191,"trial_step":191},{"step":191,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"啧，这么严肃干嘛！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_192"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404192,"trial_step":192},{"step":192,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我、我就是开个玩笑……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_193"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404193,"trial_step":193},{"step":193,"content":"玩笑？！","style":2,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404194,"trial_step":194},{"step":194,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"怎么，现在又要摆架子跟我讲规矩啦？你搞出来的这场“审查”从一开始就是乱来嘛！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_195"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404195,"trial_step":195},{"step":195,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"在天空岛吃了瘪，想趁机报复我？“用其人之道还其人之身”，也想用游戏整我？哼哼，该说你勇敢还是天真呢。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_196"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404196,"trial_step":196},{"step":196,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"再说，你这GM（管理者）也太没职业精神了吧，还总是和我对着干，我能忍到这个时候才爆发，已经不错了好不好～","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_197"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404197,"trial_step":197},{"step":197,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"所以我才想让你看看，什么才是专业控场，专业GM（管理者）！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_198"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404198,"trial_step":198},{"step":198,"content":"……","style":2,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404199,"trial_step":199},{"step":199,"content":"那海拉她们呢？","style":2,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404200,"trial_step":200},{"step":200,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"放心放心，在这里呢～","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_201"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404201,"trial_step":201},{"step":201,"content":"爱缇朝着周围挥挥手，漆黑的阴影瞬间褪去，海拉，九十九还有艾米潘，都坐在地上，有点不解地看着眼前。","style":3,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404202,"trial_step":202},{"step":202,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"啊……啊！！原来我没死啊！！哈哈哈哈！！太好了！！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_203"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404203,"trial_step":203},{"step":203,"speaker":"海拉","content":"你好吵啊！","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_204"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404204,"trial_step":204},{"step":204,"speaker":"九十九","content":"……结束了？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_205"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404205,"trial_step":205},{"step":205,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"算是结束了吧～","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_206"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404206,"trial_step":206},{"step":206,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"哦不对，这里还有一位……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_207"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1049,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404207,"trial_step":207},{"step":207,"content":"爱缇拉着你，走到阁楼，推开门一看，那位好脾气的副官小姐，此时正坐在书桌前，笑得和善。","style":3,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404208,"trial_step":208},{"step":208,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，爱缇，如果可以的话，等会到管理局，我希望你们能详细地告诉我，究、竟、发、生、了、什、么、事、情。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_209"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404209,"trial_step":209},{"step":209,"content":"目送夜莺离开阁楼，强大的巨龙与不服输的命运，相继松了口气。","style":3,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404210,"trial_step":210},{"step":210,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"下次别这么不自量力了。就凭这完成度的游戏，想挑战爱缇，你还差得远呢。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_211"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404211,"trial_step":211},{"step":211,"content":"……天空岛的帐是一回事，我手上的确有真正的宝藏。既然你勉强算通关，就拿去吧，我想也可以当做我对于游戏完成度的……一个借口吧。","style":2,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404212,"trial_step":212},{"step":212,"content":"你将夜莺留下的那本手工书，放在了爱缇手里，她一脸惊诧。","style":3,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404213,"trial_step":213},{"step":213,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"这是……我爷爷的手工书？","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_214"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404214,"trial_step":214},{"step":214,"content":"嗯，抱歉，我并不是故意要看老人家留给你的东西，当时你把它搂得很紧，为了让你好好休息，我们拿出来的时候，不小心翻开了。","style":2,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404215,"trial_step":215},{"step":215,"content":"然后，我发现书本的最后，有一个暗格。","style":2,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404216,"trial_step":216},{"step":216,"content":"暗格上面似乎残存着创世之龙的力量——我猜，里面或许有一份，爷爷想要等你能真正“掌控一切”的时候，再给你的礼物。","style":2,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404217,"trial_step":217},{"step":217,"content":"爱缇打开书本的最后一页，轻轻敲了敲手工制作的木壳封底，闷闷的声音告诉她，这个里面有一个小暗格。","style":3,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404218,"trial_step":218},{"step":218,"content":"打开暗格，里面是一封，沉睡了很久很久的信。","style":3,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404219,"trial_step":219},{"step":219,"content":"爱缇拆开信件，看着上面的字，沉默了好久好久。","style":3,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404220,"trial_step":220},{"step":220,"content":"直到天边微微泛起晨光，她才再次开口。","style":3,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404221,"trial_step":221},{"step":221,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"其实……当我再次走进这间房屋的时候，我确实慌了，我还以为又是因为我沉浸在了自己的游戏中，导致记忆被覆盖了。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_222"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404222,"trial_step":222},{"step":222,"content":"爱缇看了看手中的信，继而将它折好，放入衬衣的口袋里。","style":3,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404223,"trial_step":223},{"step":223,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"不过……谢谢你们愿意信任我，包容我，让我知道……","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_224"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404224,"trial_step":224},{"step":224,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"被信任、快乐、真诚所覆盖的记忆，不叫遗忘……应该叫做珍藏。","voice":["vo_trial_50404_1_225"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404225,"trial_step":225},{"step":225,"content":"爱缇，相信你看到这封信的时候，已经完成或者经历完我前面所写的游戏了吧？\n\n你玩得……开心吗？\n\n我相信你很开心，我也相信，此时你的身边，一定拥有了能让你信任，让你开心的伙伴了吧？\n\n呵呵……如果是这样，那我也能放心地藏在你心里最深最黑的地方，守护你的孤独与寂寞，不让它们来找你。\n\n直到这所有的黑暗，都被你变成快乐。\n\n——暗黑守护者·创世主宰者·漆黑的巨龙·老沃奇","style":10,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150404226,"trial_step":226}]}